<Base>
  <h1>Vish Vaddi</h1>
  <p>
    Sydney-based senior estimator. I price retail and commercial fit-out for
    a living — the kind of projects where a misaligned bracket buys you a
    Monday-morning email with "as discussed" in the first line. The rest of
    my time goes into building software I actually want to exist, reading
    things that won't make it into a corporate book club, and trying to keep
    a few systems running without falling over.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site is the bit of the internet I own. Some of it's professional,
    some of it's personal. None of it's a feed.
  </p>

  <hr />

